The construction-only probe replaces linprog after the complete objective,
bounds and A_eq have been built.  It therefore measures the production matrix
boundary without paying solver workspace.  The 13,000 stored entries are one
vertical contact coefficient per free body plus the two 6,000-entry sparse
slack identities.  CSR storage is 180,004 bytes; the retained 1D objective and
target vectors are 152,000 bytes.  Tracemalloc peak and process max-RSS are
host observations, not CI thresholds or universal memory laws.  Structural
shape, nnz, and array-size accounting are the representation proof.
